o find reasons to laugh.</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Charismatic characters</strong> full of life and completely animated (although this doesn't mean they have happy lives).</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1882690/extras/7474c668c781af982b36e908bf3526d4.avif?t=1730105825\" /></div>",
